      "snippet": {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "radialDiv (o) (c : ℝ) (f) = o.dr f + c • (o.invRadius * f); i.e. (D_r + c/R)f, so radialDiv 2 = D_r + 2/R and radialDiv 1 = D_r + 1/R"
